For the release archive entry to work, install com.zellydevgames.opensplit.desktop under ~/.local/share/applications and make sure OpenSplit is available on PATH.
The portal requires a matching desktop entry for host app registration (XDG Registry docs).
Older portals without the Registry method continue through the existing flow.

